# LB-07's one secret: the key its bug tokens are signed with. A test run switches the staging
# shop's bugs on with a token the Node worker signs (HMAC-SHA256) and the shop, inside the
# lb07-sandbox container, verifies, so both read this one value: Compose hands it to node-worker
# and to lb07-sandbox, and to nothing else (docker-compose.yml). Neither file is read whole by a
# container, so no other secret travels with it.
#
# A key that leaked would let someone switch bugs on in a shop that exists only inside the
# sandbox, for runs that last three minutes: rotating it means editing this file and deploying.

# 32 random bytes as 64 hex digits, made by `just secrets-new lb07-sandbox` (the service takes 64
# to 256).
LB07_SHOP_TOKEN_KEY=@token:32
